{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55220","headline":"题北京西山童子寺七言 · 李存勖","name":"题北京西山童子寺七言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时童子[慕]（募）清闲，今古犹传在此山。\n百派峥嵘流海内，千溪{山|穴/大}屼透云间。\n猿啼岭上深幽静，虎笑（应即「啸」字）岩边去复还。\n愐想翠花崚谷变，空留禅室喜登攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李存勖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}